# Portal Base — Core

Nuxt 4 auth-first portal. Chi tiết: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/E2E-TESTIDS.md`, skill `.cursor/skills/portal-base/`.

## 4 tầng (bắt buộc)

`pages/components` → `composables` → `services` + `stores` → `models` + `validations` → `$apiFetch`

- **Không** gọi `$apiFetch` trong page/component
- **Không** import ngược: `models/` → stores/services/composables
- Form: `useApiForm` + `validations/` (chặt) + `models/` (API contract)

## Thêm feature (thứ tự)

`models/` → `services/` → `stores/` (optional) → `composables/` → `validations/` → `pages/` + `testId`

## UI tiers

`components/ui/` (shadcn) → `molecules/` (`Mo*`) → `organisms/` (`Data*`, `OrGlobal*`)

Không copy legacy: `layouts/themes/*`, `dataTheme/*`.

## E2E

Playwright only (`tests/e2e/`). Gắn `data-testid` **trước** viết spec. `page.getByTestId()`.
